時報。衍年十四，時在京師，造僕射羊祜，申陳事狀，辭甚清辯。祜名德貴重，而衍幼年無屈下之色，眾咸異之。楊駿欲以女妻焉，衍恥之，遂陽狂自免。武帝聞其名，問戎曰：「夷甫當世誰比？」戎曰：「未見其比，當從古人中求之。」","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-043-wangyan:p001:m0139","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-043-wangyan:p001:m0135"}],"reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"interpretation_note":"未名女→楊駿 father，欲妻不作與衍已婚，不補名楊芷。","fixed_source_fact_binding":{"kind":"fixed_witness_person_fact_slots","key":"jin043-wangyan-finite","slot":"yangjun-daughter"}}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangyan:p001:m0139","start":139,"end":140,"surface":"女","kind":"person","person_id":"78g_qkv_lpp","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"楊駿女，僅擬婚，未成婚不補名。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-043-wangyan:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-043-wangyan"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-jin043-wangyan-yangjun-daughter","predicate":"father","subject_person_id":"78g_qkv_lpp","object_person_id":"603_131_11e","status":"source_attested","qualifiers":{"source_term":"楊駿欲以女妻焉","source_interpretation_status":"explicit_source_wording","lineage":"paternal"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-043","source_id":"s-jinshu-043-ws2618531-wangrong","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-043-wangyan","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-043-wangyan:p001","quote":"衍字夷甫，神情明秀，風姿詳雅。總角嘗造山濤，濤嗟歎良久，既去，目而送之曰：「何物老嫗，生甯馨兒！然誤天下蒼生者，未必非此人也。」父乂，為平北將軍，常有公事，使行人列上，不時報。衍年十四，時在京師，造僕射羊祜，申陳事狀，辭甚清辯。祜名德貴重，而衍幼年無屈下之色，眾咸異之。楊駿欲以女妻焉，衍恥之，遂陽狂自免。武帝聞其名，問戎曰：「夷甫當世誰比？」戎曰：「未見其比，當從古人中求之。」","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-043-wangyan:p001:m0139","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-043-wangyan:p001:m0135"}],"reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"interpretation_note":"未名女→楊駿 father，欲妻不作與衍已婚，不補名楊芷。","fixed_source_fact_binding":{"kind":"fixed_witness_person_fact_slots","key":"jin043-wangyan-finite","slot":"yangjun-daughter"}}],"title_holdings":[],"addr